---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping Policy | Fresh Petals Bengaluru"
  description="Fresh Petals delivery information: starting with Chamarajpet and Basavanagudi in Bengaluru, with availability, timing and the final total confirmed on WhatsApp."
>
  <main class="bg-paper">
    <section class="px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <p class="fp-eyebrow">
            Fresh Petals Bengaluru
          </p>

          <h1 class="fp-h1 mt-3">
            Shipping Policy
          </h1>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-moss md:text-base">
            Delivery information for Fresh Petals orders in Bengaluru, starting with Chamarajpet and Basavanagudi.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-linen p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Delivery Areas
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              We're starting with deliveries in Chamarajpet and Basavanagudi. If you're nearby, send your order on WhatsApp anyway: we check your exact address and tell you whether we can deliver before you pay.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              On WhatsApp we confirm availability, your delivery address, the delivery timing and the final total including delivery charges. Nothing is charged on this website, and a pincode is optional when you order.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Delivery Charges
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              Delivery charges depend on the delivery pincode, distance, order size and time slot. The website may show an estimated delivery fee for supported pincodes. Final delivery charges will be confirmed on WhatsApp before payment.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-linen p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Delivery Slots
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              <p>
                Share your preferred date, time and delivery address on WhatsApp. Availability, delivery timing, charges and payment arrangements are agreed before your order is accepted. A preferred time or an estimate in the basket is a request, not a confirmed delivery slot.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Same-Day Delivery
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              Same-day and express delivery are not confirmed services. Ask us what is possible for your product, date and address. We agree availability and delivery arrangements with you before accepting the order.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-linen p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Pooja Flowers, Jasmine and Garlands
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              Pooja flowers, jasmine/malli, gajra, garlands and poola jada are highly dependent on morning market availability. For these products, we recommend placing orders early or confirming in advance on WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Bulk and Event Orders
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              Bulk flower orders, temple orders, event flowers, garlands and wedding-related orders require manual confirmation. Delivery cost, handling charges and timing will be shared after understanding the quantity, location and requirement.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-linen p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Failed Delivery or Customer Unavailable
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              Since flowers are perishable, customers are requested to be available at the delivery address during the selected time slot. If the customer is unavailable or the address is incorrect, redelivery may be chargeable or may not be possible depending on flower condition and delivery route.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-paper p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
              Final Confirmation
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
              All orders are confirmed only after WhatsApp confirmation of flower availability, delivery area, delivery fee, time slot and payment details.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-linen p-6 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ink">
            Need delivery confirmation?
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-moss">
            Share your pincode, delivery date and flower requirement on WhatsApp.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919652012274?text=Hi%20Fresh%20Petals%2C%20I%20want%20to%20check%20delivery%20availability%20for%20my%20pincode."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-ink px-7 py-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:bg-berry"
          >
            Check on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
